      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In steamVR turn off motion smoothing and set the resolution of the game to custom not auto .. this will help greatly , also minimize the desktop window when in VR (recent version of the game or of SteamVR causes the pc to render the game 3x , also causing heavy lag and ghosting:(especially with video players/mirrors in worlds)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
